# Apply: patch -d "$DARKSTR_GECKO_ROOT" -p1 < patches/0002-darkstr-mode-xor-rfp.patch
# Soft residual (Proof): FPP re-assert after CB settle — observe RFP/FPP + deferred apply under Pollution.
#
